"For 24/7 DVR, add noendlist=1 and append=1 to keep playlists usable across "
"recording restarts."
msgstr ""
"Para DVR 24 horas al día, 7 días a la semana, agregue noendlist=1 y append=1 "
"para mantener las listas de reproducción utilizables durante los reinicios "
"de grabación."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.5nL9WJwhMP/lsp-markers.js:284
msgid ""
"For RTMP targets, include the stream key in the URL path: rtmp://host/app/"
"streamkey."
msgstr ""
"Para destinos RTMP, incluya la clave de transmisión en la ruta URL: rtmp://"
"host/app/streamkey."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.5nL9WJwhMP/lsp-markers.js:285
msgid ""
"For RTMPS targets (e.g. Facebook), add a trailing ? to the URL to prevent "
"parameter parsing."
msgstr ""
"Para objetivos RTMPS (por ejemplo, Facebook), agregue un final? a la URL "
"para evitar el análisis de parámetros."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.5nL9WJwhMP/lsp-markers.js:286
msgid ""
"For RTSP cameras, enable Always On to keep the connection alive continuously."
msgstr ""
"Para cámaras RTSP, habilite Always On para mantener la conexión activa "
"continuamente."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.5nL9WJwhMP/lsp-markers.js:287
msgid "For stream name"
msgstr "Para el nombre de la transmisión"

