msgstr ""
"Ingiere transmisiones en vivo a través de RTMP, SRT, WebRTC (WHIP), RTSP, "
"RIST o TS push directo."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.5nL9WJwhMP/lsp-markers.js:332
